{"data": [{"id": "2122132627025182931", "author_id": "1467588769209532422", "text": "@dotey 这看起来是在造势，这不会那么顺利，也不会那么难", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T01:00:20.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/gutoubeng1/status/2122132627025182931", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122131425654981117", "author_id": "2107064250250469376", "text": "@dotey 热闹归热闹，Kalshi 回归概率才 20%，市场定价的还是小概率事件。真正的分水岭在周二盘后财报：AI 需求指引稳不稳，直接决定股价怎么走；数字要是软，CEO 悬念和调查没结论这两件事会一起放大波动，到时候就不是 20% 的事了。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:55:33.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/moxingzhex/status/2122131425654981117", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122129903802109963", "author_id": "1486209719740289024", "text": "@dotey 三天前辞职，三天后传要回来\n这更像是在试董事会和市场的反应\n最尴尬的是临时CEO，椅子还没坐热", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:49:30.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/oxniubi/status/2122129903802109963", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 89, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122129281195356582", "author_id": "2387465491", "text": "@dotey 请愿信写得再客气，10万个签名往那一摆就是谈条件的筹码。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:47:02.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/0xm0reyu/status/2122129281195356582", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122129220075942265", "author_id": "1998058202584514561", "text": "@dotey 纳瓦尔前两天那句“黄仁勋就是英伟达的乔布斯，不可替代”，有 400 万查看。硅谷这次站队站得挺齐", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:46:47.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/DieselAI24/status/2122129220075942265", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122128820174246166", "